        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Pemko 2748A  Mill Finish Aluminum Saddle Threshold</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 2748 Series ADA compliant and fire rated 8\" wide Flat Saddle Threshold is extruded from high-quality materials, providing long-lasting superior performance. It has a height clearance of 1/4\" which aids in insulating a room and creates a smooth transition between two floor surfaces. \r\n</p>\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Pemko Door Threshold:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Mill Finish Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Certifications</b>:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA) Compliant</li>\r\n<li>UL 10C positive pressure</li>\r\n<li>UL 4L10 listed</li>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A117.1</li>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A156.21 Thresholds</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSpecial Ordered Item. <b>No Returns</b>\r\n</p>",
